CTF Army Knife Reverse Shell Generator integration

Includes payload and listener data from the Reverse Shell Generator
(revshells.com), originally developed by Ryan Montgomery (0dayCTF) and
contributors.
Reverse Shell Generator: Copyright (c) 2022 Ryan Montgomery, licensed under
the MIT License.
https://github.com/0dayCTF/reverse-shell-generator

The command catalogue in vendor/revshells/data.js is a pinned, unmodified
snapshot of the upstream js/data.js (see integration/revshells/upstream.json
for the exact commit). apps/web/lib/tools/revshells/payloads.generated.ts is
derived from it by scripts/revshells.mjs; the original command strings are
preserved verbatim.

Community modifications: the user interface is reimplemented in the CTF Army
Knife design system. The variable-substitution, encoding and OS-filtering
behaviour follows the upstream tool. These modifications do not imply any
endorsement by the original authors.

The upstream MIT LICENSE accompanies this distribution at
vendor/revshells/LICENSE.
